	quests: [
		{
			description: [
				"这些陨石拥有远超我们能力的先进技术，我们必须逆向研究这项技术，看看它能用来做什么！"
				""
				"&8章节作者：lGarlicbreadl"
			]
			id: "0C59541433431FDD"
			subtitle: "找到一个 &e坠落的陨石碎片"
			tasks: [{
				icon: "ae2:sky_stone_chest"
				id: "35BE2CE0FF4E2929"
				structure: "ae2:meteorite"
				title: "找到一个 &e坠落的陨石碎片"
				type: "structure"
			}]
			title: "奇怪的发现"
			x: 0.0d
			y: 0.0d
		}
		{
			dependencies: ["0C59541433431FDD"]
			description: [
				"&eCertus Quartz Dust&r 及其晶体变种 &eCertus Quartz Crystal&r 是你所有 &dApplied Energistics&r 相关事物的主要资源。"
				""
				"它们从&eBudding Certus Quartz&r中生长出来，类似于紫水晶。"
				""
				"过早采集会获得粉尘，而成熟的 &eCertus Quartz Cluster&r 则会提供晶体。"
				""
				"&6提示：&r &b成熟石英簇&r比未成熟的效率要高得多，并且&e可以被财富&r效果影响。"
			]
			id: "35BF66CD4FAE83DE"
			subtitle: "一切由此拉开序幕"
			tasks: [
				{
					id: "749EBE81EDA0F15E"
					item: "ae2:certus_quartz_dust"
					type: "item"
				}
				{
					id: "66A88EEA1440046A"
					item: "ae2:certus_quartz_crystal"
					type: "item"
				}
			]
			title: "Certus Quartz"
			x: 2.0d
			y: 0.0d
		}
		{
			dependencies: ["0C59541433431FDD"]
			description: [
				"Budding Certus Quartz 是所有 Certus Quartz Clusters 的来源，也是维持 Certus Quartz 供应的指定方法。"
				""
				"它们有4个阶段：&b无暇&r、&e瑕疵&r、&e破损&r和&e损坏&r。"
				""
				"When harvested through &4*barbaric*&r means and when sprouting Certus Quartz Clusters; &eBudding Certus Quartz degrade&r in the following order: &bFlawless&r -> &eFlawed&r -> &eChipped&r -> &eDamaged&r -> Certus Quartz Block"
				""
				"&6提示：&r &b无瑕的芽生伯鲁斯石英&r在簇生后不会变质，因此是&e易于自给自足的石英来源&r。但它们无法通过采矿等方式直接获取，&e即使使用丝绸之触&r也不行，你需要另寻方法以保持其品质。"
				""
				"{@pagebreak}"
				"&6提示：&r机制：纸板箱可用于运输易碎包裹 :)"
			]
			id: "33EE235B3C35EE49"
			subtitle: "这个东西是从哪里来的呢？"
			tasks: [{
				id: "37761788AB158EC4"
				item: {
					Count: 1
					id: "itemfilters:or"
