		{
			dependencies: ["353A578CDE6BFEE9"]
			description: ["如果需要更多&eCertus Quartz Dust/Crystals&r，可以将&eChipped/Damaged Budding Certus Quartz&r与&bCharged Certus Quartz Crystal&r在&9pool of water&r中结合，为&eCertus Quartz Block&r注入新生。"]
